れんの減損損失166百万円、有形固定資産の減損損失159百万円を特別損失として計上する見込みです。また、個別決算において、子会社株式評価損232百万円、関係会社事業損失引当金繰入額151百万円を特別損失として計上する見込みです。なお、個別決算における特別損失は、連結決算では消去されるため、連結業績への影響はありません。", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 29900000000, "29,900", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 410000000, "410", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 440000000, "440", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 230000000, "230", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 17.95, "17.95", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 28600000000, "28,600", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 196000000, "196", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 243000000, "243", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -207000000, "207", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeNetSales", "AmountChangeNetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -1300000000, "1,300", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeOperatingIncome", "AmountChangeOperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -214000000, "214", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeOrdinaryIncome", "AmountChangeOrdinaryInco